Designed to farm Vaettir in Hard Mode for [[gww:Glacial Stone|Glacial Stones]], mesmer tomes, golds, and event items during holiday events. This build is frequently used to attain the [[gww:Survivor|Legendary Survivor]] title.

== Frequency ==
*More common than the [[Build:E/Me Obsidian Flesh Vaettir Farmer|Elementalist]] farmer due to speed and ease of use.
*More reliable and less action-intensive than the [[Build:A/Me_Vaettir_Farm|A/Me]].
*Frequently seen during holiday events.

